  "description": "05. Image Combiner for Transparent Items is a multi-image composition workflow designed to combine or condition on multiple images in one controlled edit using the models configured in the graph. Its 6-node graph exposes 0 prompt/text field(s), 0 media input target(s), and 2 save/preview stage(s), while preserving the original editor-format graph for reference. The imported graph contains unresolved custom-node classes, so install or map the listed nodes and reconvert from the included editor graph before production use.",
